@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Public system status - expected HTTP 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/status
Accept: application/json

### Antiforgery token - expected HTTP 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

### Current session - expected HTTP 401 without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Protected facilities - expected HTTP 401 without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/facilities
Accept: application/json

### Protected dashboard - expected HTTP 401 without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

# Authenticated requests require a valid Identity session cookie.
# State-changing requests also require the X-XSRF-TOKEN header.
# Do not store credentials, cookies or antiforgery tokens in this file.
